// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Chief Interrogator Washington 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3979306182" "Chief Interrogator Washington"
// ProfessionString :
"P4018337905" "Calvin Scott"
// DescriptionString :
"P3419136496" "Head Resistance Fellow"
// LocationString :
"P2826355704" "Nova Praetoria"
// HelloString :
"P3235584509" "Hello again, {HeroName}. We need to keep this brief."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1131632843" "How did you get this number? Nevermind, good bye."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1621400507" "We're going to have to communicate pretty infrequently for awhile, {HeroName}. I've made some arrangements in your area, so lay low for awhile and then we'll get moving."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2494880918" "You have a lot going on right now and I think people might notice you were up to something if I issued you another task. Finish your business and then come see me when you've got a little time on your hands to get things done for us."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3740484391" "Things are too hot right now, talk to me when things are a little more settled."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4035221867" "This is risky business what we're doing. When you reach Security Level {Level} I think you'll be of more use to us."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P324162304" "You've done good, {HeroName}, you've done real good."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P966836164" "I'm glad you are on our side, friend. We still have a lot of work to do before the Tyrant topples."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P1649414996" "I don't trust your motives, {HeroName}."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1667030216" "I'm unsure what we have to discuss."
