"P3458167043" "Clockwork A87952"
// ProfessionString :
"P4195978367" "Clockwork Liason"
// DescriptionString :
"P425885475" "Clockwork A87952 is responsible for transmitting various issues happening in Praetoria to members of Powers Division. Many officials within the PPD do not like this, insisting that they can handle whatever is happening around the city."
// LocationString :
"P2974710330" "M.I.C.I.R."
// HelloString :
"P2593519449" "Greetings! I have plenty of tasks that a fine, upstanding member of Powers Division such as yourself could do!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P856364347" ""
// WrongUniverseString :
"P3418736136" "My scan did not recognize you in the Praetoria City registered citizen database. Please register with the Ministry of Intelligence at once."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3401741232" "Hello! I am Clockwork A87952. I have been programmed to speak in 'regular speak' in order to act as a liason to members of Powers Division. There are many tasks that require the aid of Powers Division. These tasks are all assigned to me so that I may inform you of them!<br><br>Please get in touch with me whenever you can and I shall let you know of anything happening within the glorious city of Praetoria!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3835325081" "I am afraid that I have nothing left to inform you of!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2909316371" "You have too much to do already! Please finish whatever you are working on and contact me again!"
// FailsafeLevelString :
