// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Deputy_Assistant_of_Information 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Deputy Assistant of Information 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4131248573" "Deputy Assistant of Information"
// ProfessionString :
"P1813128348" "The Deputy Assistant of the Ministry of Information"
// DescriptionString :
"P2300821088" "The Deputy Assistant of Information is little more than a clerk who works at the Ministry of Information. Though on the extreme end of friendly, it's the Deputy's choice of cologne that makes him difficult to talk to for longer than a few minutes. Despite these flaws he appears to be someone that knows a little bit about everyone in Praetoria City."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P3709376683" "Well hello there."
// HelloString :
"P1097992599" "Hello."
// HelloString :
"P3135390668" "Hi."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2604628536" "Although it is my job to know everyone and everything going on in the city, I cannot say that I know you. This rather upsets me, as I am sure you can imagine, being the Deputy Assistant of Information and all. Perhaps you should speak with {LastContactName} and ask them why I have not been made aware of your person, yes?"
// WrongUniverseString :
"P574605905" "I take pride in keeping tabs on all the new recruits coming through Powers Division and I'm afraid I haven't seen your records. What did you say your name was again?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2106668079" "Oh, I am afraid we have hit quite the dry spell of information at this point in time. But do not worry, {HeroName}, I will find us something lucrative to pursue. Quite lucrative."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2757748605" "It seems that you have already got your hands full with some other business partners. I figured we had an exclusive set up, {HeroName}. Oh, I will be fine. Go ahead and help your other friends and then we can get down to business."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4008392462" "Oh, it would be terrible news were I to send you off on a dangerous mission only to have you wind up wounded, or worse. Please come back to me when you're at Security Level {Level} and I am certain we can work out a mutually beneficial working relationship."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1176405305" "Oh, my phone. Of course. It would be quite silly of me not to be in constant contact with you, {HeroName}. After all, I am certain to have a veritable flood of valuable information coming my way anytime soon. Quite valuable."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1523860301" "{HeroName}, we make headlines together, and that is a good thing. I must say that you have become a shining example to our community under my direction. I am working on putting together a little portfolio on you to pitch to some TPN executives. Once they return my calls I am positive that they will want to draft up a very lucrative contract with you and I. Very lucrative."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2809711365" "Oh, I have no time to speak with you at the moment, {HeroName}."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1504982398" "I am unsure what we have to discuss."
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3776541590" "This contact I have introduced you to can probably move you along down the path you have chosen."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3342444154" "I have got someone I think you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P30252022" "There are a couple of people you should talk to."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page HelloPage Text :
"P1890735423" "Well hello. To what do I owe the honor of making the acquaintance with yet another of our distinguished Powers Division members? I am the humble Deputy Assistant of Information, who might you be?"
// Answer Text :
"P1037903553" "{HeroName}."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P3822748747" "It is a pleasure to meet such an amazing person as yourself, {HeroName}. Who was it again that directed you to me? I mean, I have so many people that I work with it really is a chore to keep tabs on all of them."
// Answer Text :
"P3086397578" "Provost General Marchand said you might be useful to me."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P632319929" "The Provost General!? He knows m...?<br><br>I mean. Um, well, yes. Yes, of course the Provost sent you. It is just that Gerald and I have not really had a chance to talk lately. I was merely surprised he had not contacted me earlier to tell me he was sending someone.<br><br>We are good friends, Gerald and I, so I always try and return the favor and treat his friends as my own."
// Answer Text :
"P3662606675" "I'm not here to be friends, Deputy. Marchand said you'd be useful, was he wrong?"
// Answer Text :
"P287208777" "Friends it is then. Let's talk about how this friendship will work."
// Page NotFriendsPage1 Text :
"P236763911" "Oh, no, no, the Provost General is not wrong. Nobody said that. Listen, I have seen Powers Division members come and go, and do you know what makes the difference between someone like Reese and someone like Matter-Man?"
// Answer Text :
"P1373022202" "Who is Matter-Man?"
// Page MatterManPage1 Text :
"P3368120905" "Precisely!<br><br>The public has never heard of Matter-Man. That is my specialty, {HeroName}, I will make certain that the people see the deeds you do, and when they do, you will be a household name."
// Answer Text :
"P637231348" "I'm on board, but let's see if you can deliver."
// Page FriendsPage1 Text :
"P2965221575" "Fame is my specialty, {HeroName}. I make certain that the people see the deeds you do, and when they do, you will be a household name. I have contacts at TPN, the PPD, and of course, the Ministry of Information. You will have no shortage of valiant deeds to be done with me at your side."
// Answer Text :
"P1362579409" "That sounds like a plan. Let's get started."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


