// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Jack_Hammer 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Jack Hammer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P772573562" "Jack Hammer"
// ProfessionString :
"P2112241186" "Resistance Cell Captain"
// DescriptionString :
"P3923540513" "Jack Hammer is a sort of leader to the Resistance in the underground beneath Nova Praetoria. Part of this is because of the passionate and excited speeches that he gives, rallying the people around the causes that he chooses. Of course, the <i>reason</i> why Jack is so passionate is because he has been dipping into Fixadine himself, a fact which nearly everyone knows, but no one addresses."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P194235829" "<color orange>You don't receive a signal when you try to call Jack Hammer.</color>"
// LocationString :
"P2409760342" "Underground Nova Praetoria"
// HelloString :
"P3426481962" "Don't numb yourself, {HeroName}, this is a war we're battling. Peeps are gonna get chomped."
// HelloString :
"P2211704363" "We're gonna win this thing, {HeroName}. You and me."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2971258375" "Never spied your visage before, slammer. I don't just chum up with every rat in the maze, so why don't you scram back to {LastContactName} until you can dig up some cred down here in The Dim."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P1193358334" "Not from around here, huh? That doesn't matter one bolt. We got all kinds of chompers and slammers workin' down here, but see, the thing is, they all got a slammer lip wiggin' for 'em. You don't got no lip wigger vouching for you, so I don't know if I can throw you as far as I can trust you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3590223599" "You're {HeroName}, right? {Hero.gender=male Ricochet won't stop goin' on about how 'dreamy' you are.|I heard a lot about you from Ricochet and Splice.}<br><br>Name's Jack Hammer.  Folks around here see me as a leader. Now, I don't have time to be spittin' at you, so I'm gonna talk plain-like.<br><br>If you're here, then it means you're here to help us. Or, at the very least, what you want isn't going against what we want. Here's our current situation, you know the <color red>Destroyers</color>? They're taking a bigger toll than I'd want on our boys and girls down here. We're losing slammers on a daily basis to them. We combine that with fighting off the Ghouls <i>and</i> PPD, it means bad news for us.<br><br>But I'm not gonna just lay down and let this happen, and I'm gonna be asking you to help me out with this. If that doesn't catch your interest, then here's the swinger.<br><br>You and me? We're going to <color yellow>take control of the main stash of Fixadine in this place</color>."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2913693005" "We got a lot to jaw over now that the crush is ours. Give me a tweedle-deedle later, we might have some serious slammin' that needs doin'."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1135193623" "You've got way too much to handle, {HeroName}. Talk to me when you've cleared up some things first."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P190634524" "We do a lot of things that'll get you slashered down here. Jaw with me when you're Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2004465613" "Take this, it'll let you and me talk at a distance. It's something that we're gonna need to use."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2701659207" "You better stop wastin' my time, {HeroName}, I ain't got time to talk with people who ain't gonna devote their entire selves to the Resistance."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P2178958415" "Jack Hammer is an unofficial leader of our little group down here. He's a little hooked on Fixadine but it's what makes him the kinda guy that we all follow into battle. Well, everyone else, that is."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3458530023" "Meet Jack Hammer"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3499090298" "Make sure you don't stiff Jack Hammer on any crush, it could lead to some trouble."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3292087928" "Jack Hammer's really itching to do some work with you, {HeroName}. Just don't mind his face, he's got a thing for the crush."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


