// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Marauder 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Praetor White 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4125628691" "Praetor White"
// ProfessionString :
"P1825242684" "Commander of the PPD Powers Division"
// DescriptionString :
"P2485260792" "Praetor White claims the title of Commander of the Praetoria Police's Powers Division, the 'Power Police'. As leader of the Praetoria Police department's Powers Division, he helps train all the new hopefuls. In doing so, he has the greenhorns fight amongst themselves to establish rank. It is strongly encouraged to challenge others, especially your superiors. Because of this the streets are full of green Powers Division recruits trying to get a leg up. Known as Marauder during the darkest days of the Hamidon Wars, White is well known throughout the city and respected as much as he is feared."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P4054035086" "I've got five good reasons why you shouldn't bother me. If you keep bugging me, I'll show them to you all at once."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3525152908" "Since you're automatically supposed to talk to me, I shouldn't even be saying this line to you. Either your character is bugged or you're hacking the game. I hope for your sake that it's not the latter. They don't call me Marauder for nothing."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P2901034978" "Well, well, well, what do we have here? No, seriously, who are you? I don't have you on my Powers Division recruits roster. You'd better go sort that out because it is not my job to make sure you can sign your name on the forms."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2327866546" "Listen up, 'cause I'm only going to say this once. Praetoria City's filled with yappin' little dogs like you. And do you know who I am? I'm the top dog. Keep that in mind and maybe you'll get to hang out in my pack. You put all the other dogs in their place and you get noticed. Don't and you get to sleep in the back alleys. Get what I'm sayin'?<br><br>The name's Mr. White, but between me and you, you can call me Mr. White. Got it? While Emperor Cole's off saving the world, I'm in charge of the muscle. I work hard to keep this city safe from the tunnel rats who think they can take away all we've worked for. That's where my Powers Division comes into play. I'm the Division, and all of you guys are my Power.<br> <br>Now that we got that straight, stop with the jibberjabber and let's get down to business."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3764474766" "I ain't got time for you, fool! Get out there and keep Nova Praetoria safe from criminal punks, you got it?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2231190512" "I suggest you take care of your other business and take care of it fast. When Marauder's got something for you to do, you don't keep him waiting, got it?"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P535126353" "I don't care if you go off and get yourself killed, {HeroName}, but I don't have the resources to send some men off to drag your corpse from the harbor. Come back when you're Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4024914651" "You have a phone on you? Good. Call me on my direct line from now on. Gettin' kinda tired of looking at your face all the time."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2971806631" "You know what, {HeroName}? I like how you're not afraid to get someone else's blood on your fists. From now on, I'll be looking the other way when you bust them up, if you know what I'm saying... heh."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
