// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Message Man 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3441059017" "Message Man"
// ProfessionString :
"P1275572333" "Resistance Messenger"
// DescriptionString :
"P2247775915" "No one knows where exactly Message Man is, not even members of the Resistance. This makes it easier for him to communicate news that he discovers. Message Man walks a dangerous line, and many believe one day he'll just simply vanish. Until then, he continues to try to fight the good fight against Emperor Cole and his regime."
// LocationString :
"P2011343611" "???"
// HelloString :
"P203274425" "Time to stomp some of them blueberries, eh?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
// WrongUniverseString :
"P1250681574" "Can you pop and fizzle or are you gonna goggle dazzle at my dome, slammer? You ain't catchin' my breeze, tweedle needle? Man, you're as lost as a brick in an airplane, huh? Copy this, get someone to peeper check you at the door, and we can chatter-clap, alright?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P224532957" "What's up, {HeroName}? Name's Message Man, I got it 'cause I'm good at relayin' messages. Now I ain't gonna go full on Resistance speak on you, 'cause we ain't got time to lose. You make sure to contact me every now and then and I'll make sure to give you the scoop on what's goin' on here in Praetoria. There's a lotta stuff we can do to start bringin' down the man, but all of it has gotta start with you, you know?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3369850942" "We got plans within plans now, {HeroName}, but you can take it easy, for now."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2422854410" "You gotta finish up all that stuff you got on your plate, {HeroName}, I ain't gonna give you seconds 'till then."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
