// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Calvin Scott 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4278277396" "Calvin Scott"
// ProfessionString :
"P2581526681" "Resistance Leader"
// DescriptionString :
"P2742154282" "Calvin Scott is the mastermind behind unifying the Resistance movement. Cunning and charismatic, Scott's vision of a future without Cole's tyranny has turned a rag-tag group of rebels into a serious threat to Praetoria's regime."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P67636759" "<color orange>You try to call Calvin Scott, but are re-directed to an automated message from him.</color><br><br>{HeroName}. I'm still out there, working to bring Cole down. If you're smart, you'll stay out of our way."
// LocationString :
"P849098855" "Underground Neutropolis"
// HelloString :
"P3422259692" "{HeroName}. Let's keep this brief."
// HelloString :
"P1182309061" "We're in this fight together, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P965626156" "Who are you, again? Listen, I've got a lot to do and none of it involves you. This conversation is over."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P1509996670" "Don't play innocent with me. I know where you are from, and if you think that makes you any more trustworthy, you're wrong. I appreciate the desire to help, but you coming here is just giving Tyrant more propaganda to turn the people against us and you. This is our fight, not yours."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3075084197" "Good to see you're on board with the Resistance, {HeroName}. Remember this; we need you on the inside, so play the part. We're planning everything around it.<br><br>Now then, let's see what we can do to take the fight to Cole."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3743207125" "The plan is progressing smoothly, {HeroName}. I don't have any need for you at this juncture, but in the days and weeks ahead you will get the call and we'll need you to answer. I'll contact you when the time is right."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1629458268" "Things are too hot around you right now. Take care of your tasks and then talk to me when things are a little more settled."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3776270398" "This is risky business, what we're doing. When you reach Security Level {Level} I think you'll be of more use to me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2177989061" "You've done good, {HeroName}. You've done real good."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1971305270" "I'm glad you are on our side, {HeroName}, but we still have a lot of work to do before we topple the Tyrant."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
