// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Reese 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Reese 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4292860590" "Reese"
// ProfessionString :
"P1733880855" "Alpha of Marauder's Top Dogs"
// DescriptionString :
"P54115527" "Cocky and self-centered, Reese has good reason to throw his weight around Powers Division. Of all of Marauder's Top Dogs, none have risen higher or faster than him. No other Powers Division member can match Reese's strength, skill, and cunning, a point he makes abundantly clear with the broken bodies of those who would dare challenge him."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P3937699559" "<color orange>Reese's phone rings endlessly until you hang up.</color>"
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P947339951" "Well, if it isn't {HeroName}. To what do I owe the honor? I don't actually mean honor, in case you didn't get it."
// HelloString :
"P2594992712" "You're not dead yet?"
// HelloString :
"P708352267" "Surprise surprise, everyone's favorite member of Power's Division."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3610265494" "I don't know who you think you are, hanging around here and barking at everyone. Come to think of it, I don't know who you are at all."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P311895862" "Listen, there's only one guy in Powers Division that really matters, and that's me. So until your name is spoken by someone who matters, don't bother me. Now, go get yourself registered in Powers Division and go save the city or whatever you dogs do."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1203687223" "This isn't over with us, {HeroName}. You might've gotten Praetor White on your side, but I'm gonna rise to the top. Even if it means going against you <i>and</i> White."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3993026669" "Classic rookie mistake, trying to do too many things at once. Why don't you stick around so I can brag to the others about how you're bad at multitasking?"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3332673129" "I know you look at me and think that fighting crime comes easy to me. Well, you're right - it does. When you reach Security Level {Level}, come back to me and I might throw you some crime-fighting scraps."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2248334706" "I'm tired of us talking face to face. Take this so we don't need to do this anymore."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2433882986" "You know what bothers me the most? The fact that you think I'm just gonna keep working with you after you went off and did your own thing. Scram."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P69733070" "Reese wants to meet you, {HeroName}. It looks like you got his attention."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page HelloPage Text :
"P3128617610" "Look who it is! {HeroName}, talk of the town. Heard all the things about you.<br><br>You think you're tough? Got a news flash for you. Me, I'm years beyond what you'll ever be. Name's <color yellow>Reese</color><br><br>You think just 'cause you take down a few rogue robots and make yourself look good that you really got what it takes?<br><br>That you're <i>better</i> than me?<br><br>You're not.<br><br>If we're gonna work together, you should know right away, you work for <i>me</i>. Got it?"
// Answer Text :
"P412049837" "I'm sensing you have a problem with me."
// Answer Text :
"P3854506297" "I think you really want me to hurt you, Reese. Is that what you want?"
// Answer Text :
"P2172421526" "I can see we're both going to get along perfectly."
// Answer Text :
"P3344556053" "Wait, I remember you. The loud-mouth outside the precinct during the Destroyer riot."
// Page Problem Text :
"P1450152175" "Problem? I have <i>no</i> problem at all with you.<br><br>I think it's great that some sort of lower-class person like you thinks they can go toe-to-toe with the higher ups like me. I'm done standing around and talking though. We've got a job to do.<br><br>Or rather, <i>you've</i> got a job to do. The people may want to see more of you, but it's time for us to get down to the business of protecting Praetoria.<br><br><color orange>You can sense Reese doesn't care much about actually protecting Praetoria. He thinks you'll be 'working' for him - which is pure fantasy, of course. Given his high position within Marauder's Top Dogs, you should play along for now and wait for the chance to strike. Reese will no doubt try to make a move to take you down - that's when you'll be able to beat him at his own game.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3468069617" "That's fine, I'm all about protecting Praetoria. Let's get started."
// Page Hurt Text :
"P90209610" "Maybe I do, {HeroName}.<br><br>There's going to be plenty of time for that later, I <i>promise</i> you.<br><br>Right now, you and me? We've got a situation, and it involves the Resistance. Get yourself all gussied up, or whatever you do to look like <i>that</i> and get back to me.<br><br><color orange>You can sense Reese doesn't care much about actually protecting Praetoria. He thinks you'll be 'working' for him - which is pure fantasy, of course. Given his high position within Marauder's Top Dogs, you should play along for now and wait for the chance to strike. Reese will no doubt try to make a move to take you down - that's when you'll be able to beat him at his own game.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3431293287" "I'm ready now, Reese. Let's get moving."
// Page Perfectly Text :
"P3447656649" "Sarcasm eh? Is that how you're standing here, talking to me? Time to wake up, {HeroName}.<br><br>You're prowling with the big dogs now. And I gotta tell you, we're gonna <i>tear you apart</i>.<br><br>Why don't you go get yourself ready before I send you off to your untimely death? 'Cause I'm betting you don't have what it takes to stand shoulder to shoulder with us. "
// Answer Text :
"P2118885335" "I'm plenty ready now, Reese."
// Page LoudMouth Text :
"P2743885029" "Loud mouth huh? You should be talking, running your mouth as if you didn't want to be in Powers.<br><br>And now look at you! Just another dog trying to get their biscuits.<br><br>You're going to learn the hard way that <i>I'm</i> the boss around here, {HeroName}. You're not going to be able to just smile and snark your way through this one. You understand?"
// Answer Text :
"P2688421913" "Sure. I don't agree, but I understand your warped view on reality. Let's begin."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


