// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Ricochet 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Ricochet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3652736830" "Ricochet"
// ProfessionString :
"P1346833380" "Resistance freedom fighter"
// DescriptionString :
"P3989449356" "From her broad smile and the splash of crazy in her eyes, to her dizzying speech pattern and signature pink PPD helmet, everything about Ricochet is memorable. She earned her name like most of the others do in the Crusaders: by how she got her first kill. In Ricochet's case, rumor has it, she let off a blind shot during her first engagement which ricocheted off of a PPD power field and ruptured a high pressure fuel tank. The resulting explosion took out the entire PPD squad, saving the lives of her comrades.<br><br>The other story is that the bullet ricocheted into her head."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P3206807859" "<color orange>You're unable to contact Ricochet.</color>"
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P3958347265" "Hey there, slammer! I just love Nova Praetoria, don't you? And that Emperor Cole guy is sooooo dreamy!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2741984664" "What's your deal, Jonesy? I don't just lipflap it with any mookstick who comes up to me, know what I'm saying? If you wanna hang your jaw, why don't you talk {LastContactName}'s ear off."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P425147134" "Who let the dragged cat in here? I'm not about to flap-jabber with a possible 180, know what I'm sayin? So do us both a technicality and get someone to check your oil light, cause you're makin' funny noises."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P847254108" "Looks like we've managed to give Tyrant a tasty cup of punch, if you know what I'm saying. For now, we wait and see how he and his goldilocks are going to react. I'll let you know if I need any more of your help."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3950036204" "You gotta give all of your tasks a 20-50, you know? When you got them all done, shoot back my way. I could use your help, slammer!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2829283114" "I don't wanna see you get juiced, slammer. Know what I'm sayin'? Why don't you head back my way when you're Security Level {Level}?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2435147847" "Take my tellerfone numbers, slammer. This way you can call me whenever you need to give an 11-7 to the Resistance. Know what I'm sayin?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4132496503" "You do some real good work, you know that, slammer? I know I don't say it much, but watching you out there gets my blood all going whacko! Makes me wanna take down some blueberries! Keep being a hero, {HeroName}!"
// WrongAllianceString :
"P868853302" "You got yourself dancing to the wrong loo of the skip, {HeroName}, get your frequencies back on the tube!"
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2206942349" "Meet Ricochet"
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1895454324" "Ricochet is a little... eccentric. Just nod a lot and try to follow what she's jabberin' on about."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page HelloPage Text :
"P2944805634" "Look what we got ourselves here! A new chomper, eh?<br><br>So you here to take a bite outta the hand that's feedin' the people the cake, or you here just 'cause you're in the mood for chompin'?"
// Answer Text :
"P3306565108" "I'm here to help the Resistance do what it takes to win."
// Answer Text :
"P4239061429" "Word is you guys know how to cause some chaos - that's what I'm here for."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P1692766994" "S'what I'm talkin' about there! Oh man, you ain't afraid to get scamped, are ya? 'Cause I gotta give you the sign, when Tyrant's men get us scamped, ohhhh man, do we get scamped!<br><br>And I ain't talkin' tea and cookies style, either, you know what I'm sayin'? Yeah, you're totally clappin' it."
// Answer Text :
"P1827526333" "...right. Look, what's the first plan?"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P1365409649" "Oh we got ourselves some stuff on the drawin' board here! Say, what's your tag sign anyway, chomperoonie?"
// Answer Text :
"P3127095386" "I'm {HeroName}."
// Page NotFriendsPage1 Text :
"P3322907784" "Alright, {HeroName}! So I'm gonna call ya {Hero.gender=male Chomperuskie|Chomperella} for a bit, prolly just for the next few taps of the foot, 'cause I ain't got time to be layin' down on one beach, you know what I'm sayin'?<br><br>Get yourself all homey here and let me know when you're all set for the dive, 'cause we're gonna go swimmin' in some deep buildings pretty soon."
// Answer Text :
"P51469715" "I'm ready now."
// Answer Text :
"P765467988" "Okay... I think..."
// Page ChaosPage Text :
"P1760571938" "Yeow!<br><br>Got the readin' on the whole deal of the blams and the screams, huh? Well, we do what we can here to entertain the crowd, gotta be why you're down here in the darkity dark dim, eh?<br><br>You rolled up to the rig 'cause we been sailin' on a one-way stop to the fantasy land of chaos and destruction, first stop Tyrant's tower!"
// Answer Text :
"P2671723935" "Right. Look, do all of you speak like this?"
// Page SpeakLikeThis Text :
"P176741310" "Just the ones that still got themselves a beater to be flappin' their whiters at, chompster.<br><br>I dig ya though, you got no ropes on any ships, my kinda {Hero.gender=male chomperoonie|chomperella}. Got eyes only for the prize, no snugglin' up for any bubbles or pictures that other folks are luggin' around. I got just the cake for ya to be nibblin' on, big little whiteboard that we're gonna be fillin' in. Ya should get yourself all homey here and let me know when you're all at attention to be cratin' some big B's to the big T."
// Answer Text :
"P2189222572" "...alright, I think."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


