// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Splice 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Splice 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2280926866" "Splice"
// ProfessionString :
"P1811286557" "Hacker and Technophile"
// DescriptionString :
"P1726709360" "A reclusive technophile, Splice's skill with a soldering iron has saved more lives than almost anyone else in the Resistance. She invented 'blueboxes', cheap home-made devices that allow the Resistance to send and receive messages over Praetoria City's power lines, known lovingly as 'The Static'. She's also pioneered a technique to allow cellular phones to function off the grid, a feat she boasts to have figured out in only five minutes flat.<br><br>Currently she's working on reprogramming captured clockwork androids. Of course, since the things pack dangerous weaponry the specimens her allies bring in for her are usually less than functional."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P750045415" "...someone stepped on my recorder. This is why I hate people."
// HelloString :
"P866789995" "Let's not talk long. I hate dealing with people."
// HelloString :
"P2118427121" "If only we had more robots in the Resistance..."
// HelloString :
"P1980297443" "Are you here to get things done? I don't like just standing around talking. Especially to people."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1478791589" "Not sure who you are, slappy, don't really got a mind to find out. Oh, don't take it personally, I just don't like most people. Well, all people."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P238645878" "You sure stare a lot at every mundane piece of scrap you come across, huh? You have no idea where you are, or what you're doing here, do you? How about you get a clue, then maybe I'll talk to you. Otherwise, don't bug me."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3986998207" "The name's Splice, I do the tinkerin' down here under the lion's den. I guess we're cuttin' together now. That's cool. Just so you know, nothing against you or anythin', but I hate people. Just a rule of mine, don't be put off by it."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2224034544" "You cut data pretty good for a slammer. I'm all out of fresh juice for The Static, but bounce with me later and I might have something we can cut on."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1875265261" "Word on the wire is that you're meltin' insulation, slammer. Handle your business, take care of some tasks, and lower your signature a little, then we can get back to blasting static."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P395214037" "I'm not all low-tech, scrimshaw, I know you aren't Security Level {Level} yet. Come back to me when you make the grade and we'll burn some cable."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1015416702" "You got some worth to ya, {HeroName}. Here's a secure line you can cut to me with."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
// WrongAllianceString :
"P1904621427" "Go away. I don't have time for you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P2552939542" "You've done a lot of hard cuttin' for us down here, {HeroName}, Splicey-gal's been chatterin' 'bout'cha. Says she's got somethin' real big she wants to jaw with you about."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3026615474" "Meet Splice"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3631680253" "Yeah, I think you're gonna be smooth sailin' down the coast with Splicey."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3633160421" "I got you the digits on my girl Splice, 'cept she ain't real into the whole person deal."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


