// Contact Name : Warrant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P529620251" "Warrant"
// ProfessionString :
"P428904703" "A Top Dog in the PPD Powers Division"
// DescriptionString :
"P741248751" "One of the most well known cops in Praetoria City, William Smith started as a regular beat cop. When crime started to escalate out of control, he took it upon himself to meet it head on. He modified his gear after every run-in with the lawless terrorists threatening his city. Each battle made him stronger and tougher, until he became a one man police force. He became a celebrity amongst the people of Praetoria City, and was given the nickname 'Warrant' during a TPN news hour. The name stuck.<br><br>It wasn't long before he was brought into Powers Division in order to register his customized equipment. Fighting alongside Powers Division taught him a lot and he kept working on his gear, honing it into a deadly instrument of justice. He signed a book deal, fought his way into the Top Dogs, and even guest starred on the popular TPN police drama series, <i>Blue and Gold.</i>"
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P49432202" "<color orange>You're unable to reach Warrant.</color>"
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
// HelloString :
"P1127431811" "Hello, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1145872770" "Move along, {HeroName}. There's plenty for you to be doing in this city right now instead of chatting with me."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P1223030261" "You looking for somebody? Say, I don't think I've seen you on the roster back at HQ. What's your name again?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P4290932274" "I'm glad you came to talk, {HeroName}. I'm Warrant.<br><br>Seems like you're a sudden blip on the media radar, a real shooting star... Well, I hope to keep things that way. I want you in the Top Dogs, where you belong, but unfortunately, it's not up to me. However, I do know how to work the system."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P325519724" "You handle yourself really well, {HeroName}. Watch your back out there, you never know who might be gunning for you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3444365222" "You're trying to do too much, {HeroName}. Handle some of your tasks or the media is gonna tear you apart. Trust me, they love you now, but the second you slip up, they'll smear you on the pavement."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2633058500" "I've been watching you, {HeroName}. You've got potential, but you need to earn Security Level {Level} before we can work together."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P366159516" "You've taken to this like a fish to water, {HeroName}. I knew you had the drive and the strength to be one of us."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2602914060" "Even if Reese wouldn't want you in the Top Dogs, his hand will be forced by the others, or Praetor White to give you a shot. You ever need someone to watch your back, {HeroName}, I'm there."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P274044004" "Get moving, {HeroName}. There's plenty of other things for you to do in this city."
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P3077289275" "One of my esteemed partners has informed me that he'd like to meet with you. His name is Warrant, and he is one of the Powers Division's Top Dogs, the best that Powers Division has to offer. I told him you would be pleased to make his acquaintence."
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :

