// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
// ProfessionString :
"P2748745031" "Chief Interrogator for the Ministry of Intelligence"
// DescriptionString :
"P3104512023" "The Chief Interrogator works directly for Praetor Sinclair as the liaison between the Ministry of Intelligence and the PPD. Washington has the mind of a jackal in the body of a gorilla, and enjoys nothing more than ferreting out those who are not loyal to Emperor Cole and bringing them in for an unmonitored round of questioning. "
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P3660532407" "<color orange>You're unable to get in touch with Washington.</color>"
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1995001403" "How can the Chief Interrogator help you today?"
// HelloString :
"P2804526731" "Is there something you'd like to talk about?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3614721011" "{HeroName}, right?<br><br>Well, listen to me closely, {HeroName}. I am the Chief Interrogator, and that job title holds with it... <i>certain duties</i>. Currently, I am rather booked with performing said duties on certain <i>subversive</i> elements of our society. Now, unless we have a previously arranged appointment to speak with one another, I'm afraid that I will have to reserve all of my question and answer sessions with those who have been courteous enough to <i>make an appointment</i>."
// WrongUniverseString :
"P4262512817" "What brings you to the Chief Interrogator today? Interesting, you look like you might be lost. Why don't you step into my office and we'll figure out where, exactly, you belong."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2124283047" "White told me to be expecting you, {HeroName}. He said you had some worth to you. Well, we'll be putting that to the test.<br><br>We've got a situation here in Nova Praetoria that we've been keeping hushed up, but my men in the PPD have finally gotten some leads, so now the time is right to call in Powers Division for assistance. Which brings us to you."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2433514848" "With Monroe and Swift in custody it will only be a matter of time before they crack. Until that time, however, I'm going to be rather busy. It's been a pleasure working this case with you, {HeroName}. If... No, I mispoke. <i>When</i> I learn anything new I'll let you know."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3926316547" "We've got an important case we're working here, {HeroName}. I need to be able to count on you to focus if we're going to be working it together. Finish up whatever other tasks you may have and come back to me when your head is clear."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3428765891" "The people I deal with are murderers, {HeroName}. Prove yourself to be Security Level {Level} and maybe then I can use you. Until then, you're just a liability and some paperwork waiting to happen."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2365522303" "I think we're working out well together, {HeroName}. Let's make sure things stay that way."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4070844453" "There aren't a lot of people I can trust, {HeroName}. Oh, it's as much a personal thing as a symptom of the job. You, however, I feel like I trust."
